                                                "sense_id": "49cf1991-7900-3c8c-af62-8286c274b515",
                                                "text": "Not a soul in Corlaix will dare give us bite, sup, or shelter; and we shall die starved in a ditch, all four of us—that much we are our own, but in all else we are Monseigneur’s; all else, I say, all—all."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
